<refentry id="SQL-ALTERLANGUAGE">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle id="SQL-ALTERLANGUAGE-title">ALTER LANGUAGE</refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - Language Statements</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>

 <refnamediv>
  <refname>ALTER LANGUAGE</refname>
  <refpurpose>更改一个过程语言的定义</refpurpose>
 </refnamediv>

 <indexterm zone="sql-alterlanguage">
  <primary>ALTER LANGUAGE</primary>
 </indexterm>

 <refsynopsisdiv>
<synopsis>
ALTER LANGUAGE <replaceable>name</replaceable> RENAME TO <replaceable>newname</replaceable>
</synopsis>
 </refsynopsisdiv>

 <refsect1>
  <title>描述</title>

  <para>
   <command>ALTER LANGUAGE</command>更改一个语言的定义。它唯一的功能
   是重命名该语言。只有超级用户才能重命名语言。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>参数</title>

  <variablelist>
   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable>name</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      一个语言的名称
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>

   <varlistentry>
    <term><replaceable>newname</replaceable></term>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      该语言的新名称
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </varlistentry>
  </variablelist>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>兼容性</title>
    
  <para>
   SQL 标准中没有<command>ALTER LANGUAGE</command>语句。
  </para>
 </refsect1>

 <refsect1>
  <title>另请参阅</title>

  <simplelist type="inline">
   <member><xref linkend="sql-createlanguage" endterm="sql-createlanguage-title"></member>
   <member><xref linkend="sql-droplanguage" endterm="sql-droplanguage-title"></member>
  </simplelist>
 </refsect1>

</refentry>

